{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/888a8a0279d93dd445157d6e132b1b57.avif?t=1753562433\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some puzzles in the game require an unconventional approach - intuition and experimental interaction with the environment will play a key role.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>The average time to complete the game is 40 minutes.</strong></i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a risk of seizures related to photosensitivity. Some people may experience seizures triggered by flashing lights and flickering images, which are common in video games. Even those who have never had such seizures before might be unaware of their condition. We recommend a reasonable restriction on the audience for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly 13</strong> is a horror game in the walking simulator genre with puzzle elements. As a prospective buyer, Cooper Evans, you will explore a mysterious house and try to uncover its secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the house's surroundings.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay attention to changes in the environment.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles and complete assigned tasks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/821bcfdc5356a6b8af4822d2d9758ea1.poster.avif?t=1753562433\" width=418 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/821bcfdc5356a6b8af4822d2d9758ea1.webm?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/821bcfdc5356a6b8af4822d2d9758ea1.mp4?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Anti-Anomaly Organization (AAO) has identified a unique anomaly, designated as &quot;13.&quot; To study it in detail, AAO agents have installed hidden cameras in a mysterious house that is soon to be auctioned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, eager to purchase the house at a bargain price, decides to make it their new home. As you move in with your belongings, you remain unaware of the strange events awaiting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly 13</strong> is a horror game that emphasizes shifts in time and space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/f089931842c68e535015b185f49db134.poster.avif?t=1753562433\" width=736 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/f089931842c68e535015b185f49db134.webm?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/f089931842c68e535015b185f49db134.mp4?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Dive into an atmosphere of escalating horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics:</strong> AAA-level visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5 with DLSS3 support create a detailed and ominous world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Mechanics:</strong> The gameplay is built around navigating a timeline. Be prepared for gradually increasing complexity and content depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Enemies:</strong> The entity known as Anomaly 13 constantly changes form\u2014it could be a monster, a mysterious orb, or something else entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Drawing from over 100 popular horror games, we\u2019ve blended the best elements to craft our experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.poster.avif?t=1753562433\" width=666 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.webm?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.mp4?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Typeface \u00a9 Wizard Games. 2012. All Rights Reserved.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What are you doing here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392380/cf506f0cf719801d03b99ff758657ff1bf074626.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity killed the..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392380/9e04c022faf2dba9fa2a6062b2d2a0391e0dbce4.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Chapter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3392380/a231ff28d5fac2f6f542bd94b19482c282f1379f.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3392380?t=1753562433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753562433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store