3\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Dive into an atmosphere of escalating horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Graphics:</strong> AAA-level visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5 with DLSS3 support create a detailed and ominous world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Mechanics:</strong> The gameplay is built around navigating a timeline. Be prepared for gradually increasing complexity and content depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Enemies:</strong> The entity known as Anomaly 13 constantly changes form\u2014it could be a monster, a mysterious orb, or something else entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> Drawing from over 100 popular horror games, we\u2019ve blended the best elements to craft our experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.poster.avif?t=1753562433\" width=666 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.webm?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/extras/b82ad7ff3fee38e47a86e6fb2e61defb.mp4?t=1753562433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Typeface \u00a9 Wizard Games. 2012. All Rights Reserved.</i></p>","developers":["Wizard Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392380/header.jpg?t=1753562433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s